# LUAT CHUNG: moi file van ban luu LF trong kho VA giu LF trong cay lam viec.
#
# Vi sao can dong nay du ben duoi da khai tung loai: khong co no thi cac duoi KHONG
# duoc liet ke (.java, .tsx, .dart thuong, .md, .json...) khong mang thuoc tinh nao ca,
# Git nuot nguyen xi byte cua editor. Mot lan editor ghi CRLF la ca file vao kho duoi
# dang CRLF, lan sau cong cu khac ghi LF la diff phinh ra toan bo file.
# Do that 21/9/2026: mot commit khai 7338 them / 6546 xoa, bo CR cuoi dong ra chi con
# 1524 / 732 - ExamService.java tu 6561 dong "doi" xuong con 17. Blame va review chet.
#
# eol=lf chu khong de trong: de trong thi luc checkout Git dung core.eol (mac dinh
# "native" = CRLF tren Windows), cay lam viec lat sang CRLF trong khi hien tai no dang
# toan LF. Ghim lf giu dung hien trang, khong ai phai lam gi ca.
#
# Cac luat rieng ben duoi VAN THANG dong nay vi chung dung sau.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Force LF for files that must run on Linux containers
*.sh        text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.sql       text eol=lf
grader/src/main/resources/behavior-replay-engine/*.dart text eol=lf

# Batch cua Windows PHAI la CRLF. cmd.exe chiu duoc LF o lenh mot dong, nhung vo ngay
# o khoi for/if co ngoac - bao ". was unexpected at this time" chu khong noi vi sao.
# Da cắn build-exe.cmd va grader-setup.cmd (buoc cai dat dau tien tren may moi).
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf
